  "details": "1. Open VRChat in VR\n\n2. Open your menu\n\n3. Wave your cursor around over the buttons, so that you hear the hover boops and feel the haptics that accompany them\n\n4. Wave more slowly now, and notice individual transitions.\n\n5. Every time you point at a new button, your controller vibrates, and then a moment LATER the 'boop' sound plays.\n\nIt should be obvious once you're watching for it, I swear it's almost 1/4 of a second?\n\nI'm almost positive this did NOT happen until a few updates ago (I kept forgetting to file the bug report until now).   The two used to be in sync, then after a recent major update (I think *maybe* 2025.2.1?) I suddenly noticed the weird disconnect as something new and unusual.\n\nI'm using an Index (with Knuckles controllers), I'm not sure if this is universal across all hardware or not.",
